  finding-9 v1 finding [open] to area-2 {"says":"`lib/periodicals.js`: `docs/areas/` is spelled in 26 lines across 11 code files (`lib/`, `routes/`, `public/`, `server.js`, `scripts/`), up from 17 in 10 at the 10 Nov reading, and two leaves now spell the directory: `REGISTRY_PATH` (`lib/prompts/area-registry-path.js`) and `NOTES_DIR` (`lib/prompts/area-note-format.js`, LIN-4420), neither derived from the other. Moving the notes means editing both leaves and the prose. (Drift & Coherence Review, 10 Nov; `docs/reviews/drift-coherence-review-2026-11-10.md`; count, Documentation Review; recounted, Drift & Coherence Review, 13 Nov.; `docs/reviews/drift-coherence-review-2026-11-13.md`.)"}
